{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12758","headline":"河间献王墓 · 张继","name":"河间献王墓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉家宗室独称贤，遗事闲中见旧编。\n偶过河间寻往迹，却怜荒冢带寒烟。\n频求千古书连帙，独对三雍策几篇。\n雅乐未兴人已逝，雄歌依旧大风传。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张继","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12758.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12758","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}